00:04:30.943 --> 00:04:32.243
Mister Money.

00:04:32.243 --> 00:04:34.217
The real answer to that question, really,

00:04:34.217 --> 00:04:35.680
is both.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:37.932
The funny thing is, I know tons of people

00:04:37.932 --> 00:04:39.906
with massive enthusiasm,

00:04:39.906 --> 00:04:42.228
and they can't execute dick.

00:04:42.228 --> 00:04:44.921
On the flip side, I know
people that can execute

00:04:44.921 --> 00:04:48.311
A's on all their papers,
but without that passion,

00:04:48.311 --> 00:04:50.795
