00:04:54.719 --> 00:04:57.831
So to me, I'm probably a 60/40,

00:04:57.831 --> 00:05:01.453
action execution 60, enthusiasm 40.

00:05:01.453 --> 00:05:03.102
I know a lot of people might not get that,

00:05:03.102 --> 00:05:07.235
