when I started Wine Library TV.

00:05:24.184 --> 00:05:26.367
And started that whole process and so,

00:05:26.367 --> 00:05:29.952
I'm a 60/40 execution, enthusiasm action,

00:05:29.952 --> 00:05:32.552
I might even be a 65/35.

00:05:32.552 --> 00:05:35.978
Heck, as I sit here, maybe I'm a 70/30.

